{"1352890": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Seekers Alliance: Hero's Journey", "steam_appid": 1352890, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seekers Alliance: Hero’s Journey is a roguelite deckbuilder where every run expands your strategic options. Recruit Heroes from 3 rival Factions, unlock Talents, upgrade Skill Cards, forge Artifacts, and master each Hero’s unique abilities to create powerful synergies as you uncover their stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/9b55f387cb5e59e68b5c484892072a2f.avif?t=1785923485\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras_big/9b55f387cb5e59e68b5c484892072a2f.webp?t=1785923485 width=1560 height=293 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/3163f465137181817cf2942a630a2400.poster.avif?t=1785923485\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/3163f465137181817cf2942a630a2400.webm?t=1785923485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/3163f465137181817cf2942a630a2400.mp4?t=1785923485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/fb207ae04cc7268d9a1224748f0c5cf4.webp?t=1785923485\" width=1522 height=40 /></span>Battles unfold across three strategic Zones: Attack (red), Defense (blue), and Speed (green). <br>Skill Card effects trigger only when placed into their corresponding Zones, requiring careful planning to optimize every turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/7930d0e98c86b8e0ea50f9c80f1d7a07.avif?t=1785923485\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras_big/7930d0e98c86b8e0ea50f9c80f1d7a07.webp?t=1785923485 width=1560 height=293 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/3390b25ce9a77a5a10fb34ec6ff1199e.poster.avif?t=1785923485\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/3390b25ce9a77a5a10fb34ec6ff1199e.webm?t=1785923485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/3390b25ce9a77a5a10fb34ec6ff1199e.mp4?t=1785923485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Each Hero has a unique Ultimate Skill with powerful, game-changing effects and personalized animations. Professional voice acting brings Heroes and Bosses to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/fb207ae04cc7268d9a1224748f0c5cf4.webp?t=1785923485\" width=1522 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/7f00bbd843be5238886343bd8fde5ed9.poster.avif?t=1785923485\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/7f00bbd843be5238886343bd8fde5ed9.webm?t=1785923485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/7f00bbd843be5238886343bd8fde5ed9.mp4?t=1785923485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Counter mechanic creates cinematic head-to-head clashes, rewarding careful preparation and strategic defense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/ead8c2b775d0d88cb770a9842ca8f605.avif?t=1785923485\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras_big/ead8c2b775d0d88cb770a9842ca8f605.webp?t=1785923485 width=1560 height=293 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/f90f7b00c05e9b2a93204f988c7aa791.poster.avif?t=1785923485\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/f90f7b00c05e9b2a93204f988c7aa791.webm?t=1785923485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/f90f7b00c05e9b2a93204f988c7aa791.mp4?t=1785923485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/fb207ae04cc7268d9a1224748f0c5cf4.webp?t=1785923485\" width=1522 height=40 /></span>Begin each run as a Hero with a unique Deck, Passive, and Ultimate Skill. Upon clearing each map, upgrade your Hero’s Passive or Ultimate Skill, and recruit a Supporting Hero to expand your strategy and create powerful combos. Special pairings between Heroes can create Faction-specific Hero Cards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/4443a08ee37a727c223d3710cee81419.avif?t=1785923485\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras_big/4443a08ee37a727c223d3710cee81419.webp?t=1785923485 width=1560 height=293 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/6a5d5ef483eb599e529f8f4a29a90e38.poster.avif?t=1785923485\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/6a5d5ef483eb599e529f8f4a29a90e38.webm?t=1785923485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/6a5d5ef483eb599e529f8f4a29a90e38.mp4?t=1785923485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Every basic Skill Card comes with three different upgrade paths. Select the one that best suits your current run’s strategy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/fb207ae04cc7268d9a1224748f0c5cf4.webp?t=1785923485\" width=1522 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/f979e28ade3d5fd41b92911cc004d96b.poster.avif?t=1785923485\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/f979e28ade3d5fd41b92911cc004d96b.webm?t=1785923485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/f979e28ade3d5fd41b92911cc004d96b.mp4?t=1785923485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completing runs unlocks new Skill Cards, Heroes, Talent Points, and more, expanding your options for future adventures. These unlocks persist across runs, allowing you to develop new strategies over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/94da03dd00d0eb5052cbafea810374f0.avif?t=1785923485\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras_big/94da03dd00d0eb5052cbafea810374f0.webp?t=1785923485 width=1560 height=293 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three rival Factions shape the Seekers Alliance universe, each with their own history, motivations, keywords, and unique playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/fb207ae04cc7268d9a1224748f0c5cf4.webp?t=1785923485\" width=1522 height=40 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/8e97519447bad4b4e257af6965ab353c.poster.avif?t=1785923485\" width=1170 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/8e97519447bad4b4e257af6965ab353c.webm?t=1785923485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/8e97519447bad4b4e257af6965ab353c.mp4?t=1785923485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Van Der Leck Family</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A rising power in the Sea of Data, the Van der Leck Family is young, passionate, and ambitious, yet possesses the intellect and detachment to see the big picture.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deck Traits: Direct Damage, +Attack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Card Keywords: Triumph, Assault</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with the Van der Leck Heroes if you prefer a straightforward attack, where power reigns supreme.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/fb207ae04cc7268d9a1224748f0c5cf4.webp?t=1785923485\" width=1522 height=40 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/fb207ae04cc7268d9a1224748f0c5cf4.webp?t=1785923485\" width=1522 height=40 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/738e2149ed43781aacfaa390cb12877b.poster.avif?t=1785923485\" width=1170 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/738e2149ed43781aacfaa390cb12877b.webm?t=1785923485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/738e2149ed43781aacfaa390cb12877b.mp4?t=1785923485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>House Galahad</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Operating behind codenames, House Galahad members are skilled hackers, relentless dreamers, and fearless trailblazers who fight in the name of freedom. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deck Traits: Phantom Cards, +Defense, +HP</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Card Keywords: Thwarted, Fortify</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with Heroes from House Galahad if you prefer playing it safe, and don’t mind the slower build-up of power. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/fb207ae04cc7268d9a1224748f0c5cf4.webp?t=1785923485\" width=1522 height=40 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/fb207ae04cc7268d9a1224748f0c5cf4.webp?t=1785923485\" width=1522 height=40 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/9f9ae1d2b90b9f2de2e6af036a1830a5.poster.avif?t=1785923485\" width=1170 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/9f9ae1d2b90b9f2de2e6af036a1830a5.webm?t=1785923485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/9f9ae1d2b90b9f2de2e6af036a1830a5.mp4?t=1785923485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mahdia Alliance</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>With a lineage intertwined with dragons, members of Mahdia Alliance are wise philosophers and artists who uphold tradition and safeguard ancient virtues. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deck Traits: Stats Growth, +Speed</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Card Keywords: Initiative, Haste</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with Heroes in the Mahdia Alliance for more varied gameplay and the ability to adjust your strategy on the go.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seekers Alliance: Hero’s Journey is a roguelite deckbuilder where every run expands your strategic options. Recruit Heroes from 3 rival Factions, unlock Talents, upgrade Skill Cards, forge Artifacts, and master each Hero’s unique abilities to create powerful synergies as you uncover their stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/9b55f387cb5e59e68b5c484892072a2f.avif?t=1785923485\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras_big/9b55f387cb5e59e68b5c484892072a2f.webp?t=1785923485 width=1560 height=293 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/3163f465137181817cf2942a630a2400.poster.avif?t=1785923485\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/3163f465137181817cf2942a630a2400.webm?t=1785923485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/3163f465137181817cf2942a630a2400.mp4?t=1785923485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/fb207ae04cc7268d9a1224748f0c5cf4.webp?t=1785923485\" width=1522 height=40 /></span>Battles unfold across three strategic Zones: Attack (red), Defense (blue), and Speed (green). <br>Skill Card effects trigger only when placed into their corresponding Zones, requiring careful planning to optimize every turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/7930d0e98c86b8e0ea50f9c80f1d7a07.avif?t=1785923485\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras_big/7930d0e98c86b8e0ea50f9c80f1d7a07.webp?t=1785923485 width=1560 height=293 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/3390b25ce9a77a5a10fb34ec6ff1199e.poster.avif?t=1785923485\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/3390b25ce9a77a5a10fb34ec6ff1199e.webm?t=1785923485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/3390b25ce9a77a5a10fb34ec6ff1199e.mp4?t=1785923485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Each Hero has a unique Ultimate Skill with powerful, game-changing effects and personalized animations. Professional voice acting brings Heroes and Bosses to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/fb207ae04cc7268d9a1224748f0c5cf4.webp?t=1785923485\" width=1522 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/7f00bbd843be5238886343bd8fde5ed9.poster.avif?t=1785923485\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/7f00bbd843be5238886343bd8fde5ed9.webm?t=1785923485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/7f00bbd843be5238886343bd8fde5ed9.mp4?t=1785923485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Counter mechanic creates cinematic head-to-head clashes, rewarding careful preparation and strategic defense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/ead8c2b775d0d88cb770a9842ca8f605.avif?t=1785923485\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras_big/ead8c2b775d0d88cb770a9842ca8f605.webp?t=1785923485 width=1560 height=293 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/f90f7b00c05e9b2a93204f988c7aa791.poster.avif?t=1785923485\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/f90f7b00c05e9b2a93204f988c7aa791.webm?t=1785923485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/f90f7b00c05e9b2a93204f988c7aa791.mp4?t=1785923485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/fb207ae04cc7268d9a1224748f0c5cf4.webp?t=1785923485\" width=1522 height=40 /></span>Begin each run as a Hero with a unique Deck, Passive, and Ultimate Skill. Upon clearing each map, upgrade your Hero’s Passive or Ultimate Skill, and recruit a Supporting Hero to expand your strategy and create powerful combos. Special pairings between Heroes can create Faction-specific Hero Cards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/4443a08ee37a727c223d3710cee81419.avif?t=1785923485\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras_big/4443a08ee37a727c223d3710cee81419.webp?t=1785923485 width=1560 height=293 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/6a5d5ef483eb599e529f8f4a29a90e38.poster.avif?t=1785923485\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/6a5d5ef483eb599e529f8f4a29a90e38.webm?t=1785923485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/6a5d5ef483eb599e529f8f4a29a90e38.mp4?t=1785923485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Every basic Skill Card comes with three different upgrade paths. Select the one that best suits your current run’s strategy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/fb207ae04cc7268d9a1224748f0c5cf4.webp?t=1785923485\" width=1522 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/f979e28ade3d5fd41b92911cc004d96b.poster.avif?t=1785923485\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/f979e28ade3d5fd41b92911cc004d96b.webm?t=1785923485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/f979e28ade3d5fd41b92911cc004d96b.mp4?t=1785923485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completing runs unlocks new Skill Cards, Heroes, Talent Points, and more, expanding your options for future adventures. These unlocks persist across runs, allowing you to develop new strategies over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/94da03dd00d0eb5052cbafea810374f0.avif?t=1785923485\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras_big/94da03dd00d0eb5052cbafea810374f0.webp?t=1785923485 width=1560 height=293 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three rival Factions shape the Seekers Alliance universe, each with their own history, motivations, keywords, and unique playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/fb207ae04cc7268d9a1224748f0c5cf4.webp?t=1785923485\" width=1522 height=40 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/8e97519447bad4b4e257af6965ab353c.poster.avif?t=1785923485\" width=1170 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/8e97519447bad4b4e257af6965ab353c.webm?t=1785923485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/8e97519447bad4b4e257af6965ab353c.mp4?t=1785923485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Van Der Leck Family</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A rising power in the Sea of Data, the Van der Leck Family is young, passionate, and ambitious, yet possesses the intellect and detachment to see the big picture.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deck Traits: Direct Damage, +Attack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Card Keywords: Triumph, Assault</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with the Van der Leck Heroes if you prefer a straightforward attack, where power reigns supreme.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/fb207ae04cc7268d9a1224748f0c5cf4.webp?t=1785923485\" width=1522 height=40 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/fb207ae04cc7268d9a1224748f0c5cf4.webp?t=1785923485\" width=1522 height=40 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/738e2149ed43781aacfaa390cb12877b.poster.avif?t=1785923485\" width=1170 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/738e2149ed43781aacfaa390cb12877b.webm?t=1785923485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/738e2149ed43781aacfaa390cb12877b.mp4?t=1785923485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>House Galahad</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Operating behind codenames, House Galahad members are skilled hackers, relentless dreamers, and fearless trailblazers who fight in the name of freedom. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deck Traits: Phantom Cards, +Defense, +HP</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Card Keywords: Thwarted, Fortify</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with Heroes from House Galahad if you prefer playing it safe, and don’t mind the slower build-up of power. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/fb207ae04cc7268d9a1224748f0c5cf4.webp?t=1785923485\" width=1522 height=40 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/fb207ae04cc7268d9a1224748f0c5cf4.webp?t=1785923485\" width=1522 height=40 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/9f9ae1d2b90b9f2de2e6af036a1830a5.poster.avif?t=1785923485\" width=1170 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/9f9ae1d2b90b9f2de2e6af036a1830a5.webm?t=1785923485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/9f9ae1d2b90b9f2de2e6af036a1830a5.mp4?t=1785923485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mahdia Alliance</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>With a lineage intertwined with dragons, members of Mahdia Alliance are wise philosophers and artists who uphold tradition and safeguard ancient virtues. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deck Traits: Stats Growth, +Speed</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Card Keywords: Initiative, Haste</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with Heroes in the Mahdia Alliance for more varied gameplay and the ability to adjust your strategy on the go.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Seekers Alliance: Hero’s Journey is a roguelite deckbuilder where every run expands your strategic options. Recruit Heroes from 3 rival Factions, unlock Talents, upgrade Skill Cards, forge Artifacts, and master each Hero’s unique abilities to create powerful synergies as you uncover their stories.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/a3b1e15bdb379190f82b00b89390d2bd48fa39d9/header.jpg?t=1785923485", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/121cd20c93c2cf71cc1d0c184d6c349a4ad103f6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785923485", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/121cd20c93c2cf71cc1d0c184d6c349a4ad103f